es>L</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Grimont</surname> <given-names>PAD</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Weill</surname> <given-names>FX</given-names></string-name> <article-title>Prevalence and characterization of extended-spectrum cephalosporin-resistant non-typhoidal <italic>Salmonella</italic> isolates in adults in Saint Petersburg, Russia (2002&#x02013;2005).</article-title><source>Microb Drug Resist</source> <year>2007</year>;<volume>13</volume>:<fpage>102</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>7</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1089/mdr.2007.712</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17650961</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R12"><label>12. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Espi&#x000e9;</surname> <given-names>E</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>de Valk</surname> <given-names>H</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Vaillant</surname> <given-names>V</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Quelquejeu</surname> <given-names>N</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Le Querrec</surname> <given-names>F</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Weill</surname> <given-names>FX</given-names></string-name> <article-title>An outbreak of multidrug-resistant <italic>Salmonella enterica</italic> serotype Newport infections linked to the consumption of imported horse meat in France.</article-title><source>Epidemiol Infect</source> <year>2005</year>;<volume>133</volume>:<fpage>373</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>6</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1017/S0950268804003449</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15816165</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R13"><label>13. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Carattoli</surname> <given-names>A</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Miriagou</surname> <given-names>V</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Bertini</surname> <given-names>A</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><s